    "adapt": "The church nave in the building's own frame: the door end is +z (the street side the scout's entrances face), the altar end -z, the nave about 20 m wide (x) by 34 m long (z). Three candle holders and two flower pots dress the altar end, one flower pot stands by the door, and the `bench` resident anchor sits in the nave beside the pews so a resident whose line says `sit` takes a free seat within 2.5 m of it. The slot's place marker is the `Church` kind and switches the building's destruction off (D15). The same kit shape serves the crypt b08 (it stands at the same spot). Rows are rigid: shift, never stretch."
